# Model Routing Hints

When delegating via `Task`, recommend a model when the tool supports `model`:

| Phase | Model hint |
|-------|------------|
| Triage / classification | fast model |
| Bug diagnosis | reasoning/thinking model |
| Architecture / design | high-quality reasoning model |
| Code implementation | fast model |
| Code review | high-quality reasoning model |
| Documentation | fast model |
| Security audit | high-quality reasoning model |

## Command → phase

| Command | Phase |
|---------|-------|
| Bug diagnosis | `zoo-diagnosing-bugs` |
| Feature, refactor, explore, DDD, API-first | Architecture |
| Code review | `zoo-code-review` |
| Tweak, TDD, verify, implement | Implementation |
| Triage | `zoo-triage` |

## Overrides

- **Cost-conscious:** downgrade one tier (pro → fast)
- **Quality-critical** (auth, payments, security): upgrade one tier (fast → pro)

Track in `.zoo-flow/feedback.jsonl` with `model` field for validation over time.
